physicalRef: claim_line/database
description: "Provider billing fraud Link Analysis showcase - One row per billed claim line: provider, member, service date, an invented procedure code (OFV office visit, SPV specialist visit, PHY physiotherapy session, LAB, IMG-XR / IMG-CT / IMG-MR imaging, INP hospital stay), the visit level 1-5 (office visits only), billed and paid amounts, the date received and, for a reversal line (negative amounts), the claim line it reverses. One file per service month (CLAIM_LINE_YYYYMM.csv); the next month is in data/staged. Landed by the claim_line Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: service_date
columns[10]{name,type,classification}:
  claim_id,string,
  provider_id,string,
  member_id,string,
  service_date,date,
  procedure_code,string,
  level,number,
  billed,number,
  paid,number,
  received_on,date,
  reverses,string,
